@startuml 3.5.4 - Approve Media Package
title Sequence Diagram — 3.5.4 - Approve Media Package

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
entity "MediaPackageRepository" as mediapackagereposito
entity "WorkspaceMediaPackageRepository" as workspacemediapackag
control "MediaPackageService" as mediapackageservice
boundary "MediaPackageController" as mediapackagecontroll
actor "nUser (Client / Agency)" as nuserclientagency
boundary "WorkspacePackageUI" as workspacepackageui

' === Flow ===
nuserclientagency -> workspacepackageui: reviews negotiated terms and clicks "Approve Package"
workspacepackageui -> mediapackagecontroll: POST /api/v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/media-package/approve
else both Agency and Client approved same terms version
  mediapackageservice -> mediapackageservice: set negotiationStatus = APPROVED
end

else caller is Agency (Owner / Manager)
  mediapackageservice -> mediapackageservice: set approvedByAgencyAt = now

alt caller is Client
  mediapackageservice -> mediapackageservice: set approvedByClientAt = now
end

mediapackagecontroll -> mediapackageservice: approvePackage(workspaceId, currentUser)
mediapackageservice -> workspacemediapackag: findByWorkspaceIdForUpdate(workspaceId)
workspacemediapackag --> mediapackageservice: workspacePackage

alt package already in APPROVED status
  workspacemediapackag -> mediapackagereposito: findById(packageId)
  mediapackagereposito --> workspacemediapackag: mediaPackage
  workspacemediapackag --> mediapackageservice: WorkspaceMediaPackageResponse (status: APPROVED)
  mediapackageservice --> mediapackagecontroll: 200 OK (already approved)
  mediapackagecontroll --> workspacepackageui: show notice ('Package is already fully approved')
else caller is unauthorized
  mediapackageservice --> mediapackagecontroll: throw BusinessException (403 WORKSPACE_ACCESS_DENIED)
  mediapackagecontroll --> workspacepackageui: 403 Forbidden (WORKSPACE_ACCESS_DENIED)
  workspacepackageui --> nuserclientagency: show error toast ('Access denied')
end


alt single party approved (pending other party)
  mediapackageservice ->> workspacemediapackag: save(workspacePackage)
  workspacemediapackag --> mediapackageservice: savedPackage
  mediapackageservice ->> mediapackagereposito: findById(packageId)
  mediapackagereposito --> mediapackageservice: mediaPackage
  mediapackageservice --> mediapackagecontroll: WorkspaceMediaPackageResponse (one approval timestamp set)
  mediapackagecontroll --> workspacepackageui: 200 OK (one approval timestamp recorded)
  workspacepackageui --> nuserclientagency: show toast ('Approved terms version. Awaiting second party confirmation')
else both Agency and Client approved same terms version
  mediapackageservice ->> workspacemediapackag: save(workspacePackage)
  workspacemediapackag --> mediapackageservice: savedPackage
  mediapackageservice ->> mediapackagereposito: findById(packageId)
  mediapackagereposito --> mediapackageservice: mediaPackage
  mediapackageservice --> mediapackagecontroll: WorkspaceMediaPackageResponse (status: APPROVED)
  mediapackagecontroll --> workspacepackageui: 200 OK (status: APPROVED)
  workspacepackageui --> nuserclientagency: show success modal ('Media Package fully approved! Ready to create Campaign')
end

@enduml
